            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2+EXO.21.3+EXO.21.4+EXO.21.5+EXO.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 21:2–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12+DEU.15.13+DEU.15.14+DEU.15.15+DEU.15.16+DEU.15.17+DEU.15.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 15:12–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mueburania myao achidziguza kpwako kpwa kukala ni mchiya, usimuhende akuhumikire dza mtumwa. Muhende dza mchibaruwa au mcharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andasagala nawe dza mchibaruwa au kama mcharo. Andakuhumikira hadi mwaka wa kuikpwa huru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka hinyo ni umrichire huru iye na anae auye kpwao kpwa mbarize kpwenye munda wa akaree. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala Aiziraeli ni atumishi angu ambao naatuluza kula tsi ya Misiri, phahi, asiguzwe dza atumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usimuhendese kazi chisiru nduguyo, ela muogophe Mlunguo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaweza kugula atumwa kula kpwa mataifa ganjina jirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya unaweza kugula atumwa kula kpwa ajeni asagalao phamwenga nawe na jamaa zao ariovyalwa kpwenye tsi yenu, nao andakala maliyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo unaweza kuahenda atumwao na kuapha anao akale mali yao hata kare na kare, ela usimuhendere mai nduguyo Muiziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mjeni au mcharo asagalaye kahi yenu akakala tajiri na Muiziraeli myao achikala mchiya na kudziguza kpwa hiye mjeni au hiye mcharo au kpwa mmwenga wa jamaaze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ana haki ya kukombolwa, mmwenga wa abarie anaweza kumkombola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akale ni aphuye, mkpwoiwe au mbariwe. Piya anaweza kudzikombola mwenye napho akaongokerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye na yuya ariyemgula, andaisabu miaka hangu ariphodziguza hadi mwaka wa kurichirwa huru. Maripho ga kukombolwakpwe gandalengana na maripho ga mchibaruwa kpwa miaka ichiyosala kufikira mwaka wa kuikpwa huru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho isabu ya miaka ichiyosala ni minji, andadzikombola kpwa kuripha seemu kulu ya bei ariyogurirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho ikasala miaka michache kabila kufikira mwaka wa kuikpwa huru, andapiga isabu na ariphe kulengana na miaka ichiyosala ili kudzikombola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muda wosi anaphokala kpwa tajiriwe analondwa kuhenderwa kama mtumishi wa mshahara chila mwaka. Hiye ariyemgula asimuhendese kazi chisiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala mutu hiyu kakakombolwa kpwa njira hizo, phahi mwaka wa kuikpwa huru uchifika naarichirwe huru phamwenga na anae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli ni atumishi angu, mana náatuluza kula tsi ya Misiri. Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
